<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01269#mocking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is mocking, conveyed through the juxtaposition of Kermit the Frog, a well-known fictional character, with the text 'definitely not a Muslim'. The cheerful, waving gesture of Kermit contrasts with the dismissive and derogatory text, creating an emotional tone of ridicule and mockery towards Muslims. This is not an emotion expressed by Kermit himself, but rather an emotion embedded in the meme's structure and intent."@en .
