<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VerticalAdjacency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01269#religious_identity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme references the religious identity of 'Muslim' as a group. This is not visible in the image but is central to the meme's message. The text 'definitely not a Muslim' implies a binary or exclusionary view of religious identity, which is a real-world concept that the meme exploits for its effect."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Perspectival> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Perspectival"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#verballyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#contradicts> .
