<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01269#meme_format> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The format of the meme — a popular character with a dismissive or mocking text overlay — is a cultural phenomenon. This format is used to convey a message through juxtaposition, often to ridicule or stereotype a group. Understanding this meme format is necessary to interpret the meme's structure and intent."@en .
